Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21

On greeting
    If quest 538 is started and player lacks 910220000
        Say "The patrol yesterday spun the story to load, but someone is scuttled out of trekked haneungunyo. Kalluga Valley direction, did not know exactly where you have to move. Will be in place to take because there was no big deal."
        Topic "Confirm" do
            Transaction
                Give 1 of 910220000
    Else if quest 610 is started and player lacks 910242000
        Say "Lots of buildings are burned in a day. No one knows where the fire starts or what causes it. The only thing that people are aware of is that the fire usually breaks out at night, but nobody has seen the fire started. These days, no one knows what people are thinking because all the people are mentally hazed . . . ."
        Topic "What happened?" do
            Transaction
                Give 1 of 910242000
    Else
        Say "What mission are you going to undertake?"
        If no topic fits
            Say "There are too many sentinels around.. Come back some other time.."
            Topic "Close" goto close
